        },
        {
            "Id": 150021023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150021,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "唉……您的实力，我是认可的。/n但是叶羽小姐，实在太缺乏上进心了。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500210200",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150021024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150021,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "以您原本的能力，明明可以做得更多。/n可最近不是一直只完成最低限度的指标吗。",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500210210",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150021025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150021,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "？？？",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "您要是不认真起来，我会很困扰的。/n有在听吗，叶羽小姐？",
            "VoiceFileName": "1500210220",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 150021026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 150021,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "好好好，我知道了啦。/n那有事再联系～就这样～。",
